From 8c77731d000e2945961626e93cc297fb68b0c927 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ivory <contact@ivory.cafe>
Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 21:46:41 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 19/32] manager: config UI, view-model, and validation; drop
 MutationAuthenticator

Compose config screen, R0dumpManagerViewModel state model, capture-point
registry, and the domain FusionConfigValidator/Schema. Remove the
MutationAuthenticator gate and its test in favor of owner-user +
foreground checks in the view-model.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
